      "writtenOn": "2023-05-10T22:41:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The value should not change from the one in overlay so it\u0027s okay if modification doesn\u0027t persist.\nWe do not expect this value to change at all (no one should be writing to Settings Global to modify this value).\n\nThe reason why we chose to store the value in Settings.Global was to communicate between bluetooth and wifi module (without adding a new API - feature was requested past the API deadline).\n\nI have a bug tracking the cleanup of this.\nWe will not be using Settings.Global permanently, and I\u0027ll add a formal API for communicating between bluetooth and wifi module.",
      "parentUuid": "6f7d7037_c588b4c4",
